senses.gloss:
सं-√ चक्ष् Ā. -चष्टे (pf. p. चक्षाण; Ved. inf. -च॑क्षे and -च॑क्षि),
to look attentively at, observe, notice, consider, survey, examine, reflect upon, RV.; AV.; R.; BhP.;
to enumerate, ŚBr.; Lāṭy.;
to report or relate fully, MBh.;
to call, name, Car.;
to avoid, shun (aor. सम् अचक्षिष्ट), Vop. (cf. अव- and परि-संचक्ष्य).

सं-√ चर् P. -चरति (rarely Ā. ˚ते; cf. Pāṇ. i, 3, 54, Sch.),
to go or come together, meet, join, Gīt.;
to come near, approach, appear, RV.; AV.;
to go or wander about, walk about, roam, go or drive or ride in or on (instr.), AV. &c. &c.;
to reach to (आ), Kum.;
to go in or through, enter, traverse, pervade, AV. &c. &c.;
to pass over to, pass from one to another (gen.), Pañcat.;
to issue from (abl.), ŚBr.;
to move, live, exist, be, ŚBr.; ŚrS.; Bhartṛ.;
to practise, perform, BhP. :
Caus. -चारयति, to cause to come together, make to meet, bring into contact, VS.; ŚBr.; Lāṭy.;
to cause to go, set in motion, Kālid.; Hit.;
to lead about, turn out (to graze), Śak.; BhP.;
to cause to pass through, BhP.;
to let pass, hand round, Car.

सं-√ चल् P. -चलति, to move about or to and fro, waver, oscillate, quiver, tremble, MBh.; R.;
to move away, set out or depart from (abl.), Hariv.; Śak. (v.l.);
to start or jump up from (a seat), R. :
Caus. -चालयति, to cause to move about or to and fro, shake, agitate, Hariv.; Śak. (v.l.);
to push away, remove, expel, MBh.

सं-√ 1. चि P. Ā. -चिनोति, -चिनुते, to heap together, pile up, heap up, ŚBr.; ŚrS.;
to arrange, put in order, ib.; Bhaṭṭ.;
to accumulate, gather together, collect, acquire, Mn.; MBh. &c.

सं-√ 4. चित् (only pf. p. P. -चिकित्व॑स्, and 3. pl. pf. Ā. -चिकित्रे and -चिकित्रिरे), to observe together, survey, notice, RV.;
to agree together, be unanimous, ib. :
Caus. -चेतयति (pr. p. -चेतयमान), to observe, be aware of, perceive, MW.

सं-√ चुद् Caus. -चोदयति, to impel, push on, drive, shoot off, MBh.; R.;
to inflame, arouse, animate, instigate, further, ib.; BhP.;
to brandish, wield, MBh.;
to summon, challenge, ib.;
to procure quickly, assist to obtain, RV.
